<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Hagai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hagai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hagai</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hagai</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Hagai chekhai, now arui khin dow 520 BC khe chekhai. Risi Hagai dow Babulawn pren kowi takhang mih hownia uang plan mih aia maru Israeluüa tut-e kowh Thurai lai tek mih risi chekhai. Babulawn pren kowi kowh takhangra hownia uang plan mih Israeluüa tut-e natek Thurai lai kownkow uang chinah mih risi sum ia kowi Hagai dow uang rik uang mih risi chekhai, now akeng mih pre ia mih risi dow Zekaria hai Malaki iüah chekhai. Mami bowih achachow mih kowi kowh satang dow aiachow chekhai. Nami satang dow, “Thurai chup kim plan thawp iawk diah,” pami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Cham takhang miuüa amatni pren kowi uang plan mih 16 ning kung kowi paw Thurai chup kim thawp mih chur dowi tak chekhai (Ezra 5:1). Hagai kowi Thurai uang chinah mih dow naplan thawp Thurai chup kim iawk kown mih süngürra maru-uüa kowi pacham peah lah pakowh chekhai, now uanh kowi cham irh mih rakowi pacham nangah lah pakowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hagai mih Thurai kowi ringkaw dowi mih chenchapuüa kowi Thurai naripah kown mih lawnguan paw tekla khai. Nami klen kowi pur prakowi Thurai maru-uüa naka kraingra kown mih lawnguan paw Hagai phuangla khai. Hagai tekla mih pur pra kowh nauang ting kown mih lawnguan kowi amülüng mih laiklow uowi pre buk. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Enni tut-e ang tawi uowi reng,” pami chekhai (1:13; 2:4), now “Tawng iawng chow enni chowm uowi mih kaneuma tuakah büah diah,” pami chekhai (1:5,7; 2:15,18).</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Nathawp Thurai chup kim iawk kown mih ana 1:1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Thurai chup kim thawp miuüa kowi peah süngürra mih 2:1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Angak hownia natarip kown mih laiklow 2:10-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Pur prakowi tara chetra nauowi kown mih hai naplan thawpah iawk kown mih lawnguan kowi kowh pur pra laiklow 2:20-23</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1" />
  <para style="s">Nathawp Thurai chup kim kown mih ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1" />Persia pren kowi Darius chowm mang mih pre ning khe Juda pren kruitown mih dow Sealtiel kowh chapa Zerubabel chekhai, now uamow lang kri mih dow Jehozadak kowh chapa Josua chekhai. Nami ning taruk la kowi kowh lacher pani khe Zerubabel hai Josua iüah kowi nauang tek pe kownkow risi Hagai kowi CHAKRAMANG uang tek pe mih, <verse eid="HAG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2" />“Ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, maiawngün maru-uüa tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kim nathawp kown mih khin kawmat nadowi tak,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="HAG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3" />Nakhowk khe maru-uüa tut-e risi Hagai kowi CHAKRAMANG chinah hanow maiawng kowpe tekah khai: <verse eid="HAG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4" />“Enni matia dow kim iungma mih kowi enni uowi. Tawkche ang kowh kim dow apiaknama enni towta hüah khai. Naiawng enni chang mih taka khai bow? <verse eid="HAG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5" />Ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk. Tawng iawng chow enni chowm uowi mih tuakah büah kaneu. <verse eid="HAG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6" />Ahuma enni sawt liu chepaw luprak ditchow taih enni ka reng. Enni cha chepaw katpaw enni duh dowi chekhai. Enni kham grep tui chepaw duh pat chi enni ka kham dowi. Enni khup tawnguat chepaw enni kowh kow den dowi chekhai. Enni kaah mih tangka pawisa dow apükma mih im kowi enni towah iawng katpaw takrüm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="HAG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7" />“Naiawng rakowi tawng iawng chow enni chowm uowi mih tuakah büah kaneu diah. <verse eid="HAG 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8" />Kawmat dow hungma mawngma kowi cham krawi tu singh büah hanow thawp ang kim büah bowt. Naiawng enni chang hanow ang naawmrawm enni kown, now ang naka ringkawra kown. <verse eid="HAG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9" />Luprak ahuma ka kown mih enni sakowmta hüah chowdiah. Tawkche enni ka luprak mih dow ditchow taih. Kim kowi kowh enni uang kuala mih luprak maten ang rownta enni bowk khai. Naiawng ang chang enni mih dow ang kowh kim apiaknama enni towta hüah mih rakowi chekhai. Naiawng apiaknama ang kowh kim uowi khowk chepaw enni matia kim prakowi chowtaih enni lang towsak khai. <verse eid="HAG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10" />Naiawng rakowi mukuang hownia kowh nang tui hai laih kowi kowh luprak mih enni vüi ang taingta khai bowt. <verse eid="HAG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11" />Enni kowh pren kowi üa, laih, hungh, mawng hai enni kowh luprak, grep krum, kanrawn khang, maru, tawncher, krawng luk kowi kowh enni ienah mih chap maten kowi uang nauang dowi kownkow ang peta ana khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="HAG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maru-uüa chün CHAKRAMANG laiklow mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi kram rakowi Sealtiel kowh chapa Zerubabel, Jehozadak kowh chapa uamow lang kri mih Josua hai akeng mih maru maten amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng hai risi Hagai tek iawng chang khai bowt. <verse eid="HAG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13" />Nakhowk khe Hagai hownia maru kawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang CHAKRAMANG mih enni tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="HAG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih Juda pren kruitown mih Zerubabel, uamow lang kri mih Josua hai akeng mih maru maten kowh saktuak uang thowr pe khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai chup kim nachang kownkow tarowng khai bowt. <verse eid="HAG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15" />Naiawng Thurai chup kim chang amatni tarowng mih dow Persia pren kowi Darius chowm mang mih pre ning kowi kowh taruk la kowi lacher 24 ni khe chekhai.<verse eid="HAG 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2" />
  <para style="s">Klangiungma nathawp Thurai chup kim sar kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1" />Akung kowi ranit la kowi kowh 21 ni khe risi Hagai kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="HAG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2" />“Juda pren kruitown mih Sealtiel kowh chapa Zerubabel, Jehozadak kowh chapa uamow lang kri mih Josua hai akeng mih maru maten kowi kowlünta madiah. En nalüntaah kown mih, <verse eid="HAG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3" />‘Enni pungmadawng kowi alai kowh mami Thurai chup kim klangiung krang khi mih uowi ne bow? Now kawmat tawng iawng chow mami Thurai chup kim enni khi? Alai kowh mami Thurai chup kim klangiung krang kawmat kowh hown tuah e kawmat kowh dow tawngpaw nadowi tak pami enni ka tuak tak bow?<verse eid="HAG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4" />“‘Nachenganchepaw aw Zerubabel, sakkraingma uowi diah. Aw uamow lang kri mih Jehozadak kowh chapa Josua, sakkraingma uowi diah. Aw pren kowi kowh maru-uüa, sakkraingma uowi büa diah. Enni bowkbowk chang lup büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila enni reng chekhai. <verse eid="HAG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5" />Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt khe ang lümla natawi uowila enni reng kown taih pahai ang takham khai. Nami powm iawng kawmat paw ang lümla mih enni tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi hangkow kram büa diah.<verse eid="HAG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6" />“‘Ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk. Khin kra dowi bowt kowi mukuang, lusa, sata hai krawng mih lihowng uang khe kowh iawng ang nahowngah pakat iawk kown. <verse eid="HAG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7" />Chenchapuüa maten kowi naiawng ang howngah mih khin khe dow amatni mih amatni kowh dawngthawnguan mami ang kowh chup kim kowi nauang pawla kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang kowh chup kim kowi kraingra natek kown. <verse eid="HAG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8" />Tai paw ang kowh chekhai, now kuh paw ang kowh chekhai. <verse eid="HAG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9" />Alai khe kowh ang kowh chup kim lak-e kawmat kowh ang kowh chup kim mih nalang kri kraing kown. Mami arah kowi ang nauang pawla taking tasangra bowt kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="HAG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asürlawkma mih chenchap kowi peah prasi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10" />Persia pren kowi Darius chowm mang mih pre ning kowi kowh taku la kowi lacher 24 ni khe risi Hagai kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="HAG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11" />“Ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, ari aiang lawnguan kowi uamowuüa kowi kowlünta madiah. En nalüntaah kown mih, <verse eid="HAG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12" />‘Laiuan kowi, maru lowk ia nacham changla phuchua kownkow chimsaima mih chaknga uan hown duala now cham tarü khai. Nakhowk khe nami uan mih kawm, chakkham eng ia, grep tui, kanrawn sau hai akeng mih chap kowi cham takak khai e dow naiawngün uanh natawi chimsai kown bow?’ pape madiah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:12">Naiawng Hagai lüntaah khe uamowuüa klangah mih, “Chimsai dowi iowh,” pakhai.<verse eid="HAG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13" />Nakhowk khe Hagai plan lüntaah mih, “Naiawng now cham kakta uak kowh tasür talawk khowk mih maru lowra mih uanh kowi cham kakta khai e dow nami uanh natawi tasür talawk kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:13">Nakhowk khe uamowuüa klangah mih, “Ow, nami uanh dow natawi tasür talawk kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="HAG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14" />Nakhowk khe Hagai tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Nami powm iawng ang mik kowi paw mami maru-uüa hai mami chenchapuüa mih asür alawkma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni changah mih lup hai amatni phuchuaah mih uanh maten paw asür alawkma chekhai. <verse eid="HAG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15" />Kawmat hownia dow ang kowh chup kim apiaknama uowi khe tawng iawng chow enni uowi mih tuakah büah kaneu diah. <verse eid="HAG 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16" />Nakhowk khe dow nakowpaw luprak pirmi mawn kown mih sakowmma hown kowkowi khe hamüt mawnchow taih kowka khai. Sakowmma hown grep tui 50 set nakowpaw kownkow kowkowi khe 20 setchow taih uang kala grep tui khai. <verse eid="HAG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17" />Enni kowh luprak keu müa hai piak müa rawka ün ang uang pawla enni khai; enni lupah mih maten luk kowi ria hown ün ang pe piakah khai. Nachenganchepaw tarip hanow ang prakowi enni uang plan dowi chekhai. <verse eid="HAG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18" />Ani taku la kowi kowh lacher 24 ni kowi dow ang kowh chup kim nachang kownkow enni phükta achüng khai bowt. Khaleng dow enni vüi tawng chow ang nachang enni kown mih mü büa diah. <verse eid="HAG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19" />Kawmat dow enni kowh chapam kowi cha liu uowi dowi chekhai, now enni kowh grep rui, uidut singh, dalim singh hai kanrawn singh kowi ün auih e chow chekhai. Nachenganchepaw ani hownia bowt now ang nape enni prasi bowt kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="HAG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zerubabel kowi CHAKRAMANG peah prasi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20" />Nami ni khe risi Hagai kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe mih, <verse eid="HAG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21" />“Juda pren kruitown mih Zerubabel kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Mukuang hai lusa mih lihowng uang khe kowh iawng ang nahowngah kown. <verse eid="HAG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22" />Manguüa kowh mang chowm rah mih ang napawta pe kown, now amatni kowh nowng changra kür mih ang napiakta pe kown. Kawrnga kari hai kari te miuüa kowi ang naküata lut kown. Now kawrnga hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa kowi amatni kowh tainau-uüa saidawng kowi ang nape kowngah kown. <verse eid="HAG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23" />Aw Sealtiel kowh chapa ang kowh nar Zerubabel, nami ni dow ang vüi kowi en nakruitown pren kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowi dow ang lang klo en mih chekhai,’ pape diah. Mami laiklow dow ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="HAG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2" />
</usx>